This is navigation search, not patient-record search: the supplied options are static shortcuts and query filtering is local. Empty matching results show a “No operational items match…” message. See [`global-search-modal.tsx`](../packages/ui/src/components/shell/global-search-modal.tsx).

## 3. Route/page inventory

### Public and system routes

| Route | Page and purpose | Main contents / behavior |
|---|---|---|
| `/` | Entry redirect | Redirects to `/login`. |
| `/login` | Staff sign-in | Branded split image/form layout; staff email and password; email-domain warning and authentication error notifications; sign-in; system overview link; session-check loading state. |
| `/activate` | Staff first-time activation | Email, 4-digit PIN, password and confirmation; validates domain, PIN length, password length and matching passwords; completion state and explicit account/PIN/attempt/network errors. |
| `/dashboard` | Operational command center | Four KPIs; quick actions; four operational tabs; schedule, therapy suites, pending clinical tasks and API/auth diagnostic. See detailed description below. |
| Any unmatched route | Not found | Not-found page with return-to-dashboard action. |
| Global route error | Error fallback | Reports exception to Sentry; Retry Action and Return to Dashboard. |
| Route loading | Loading fallback | Shared page loading skeleton. |

Authentication entry files: [`login/page.tsx`](../apps/web/src/app/%28auth%29/login/page.tsx), [`activate/page.tsx`](../apps/web/src/app/%28auth%29/activate/page.tsx). Global error/loading routes: [`error.tsx`](../apps/web/src/app/error.tsx), [`loading.tsx`](../apps/web/src/app/loading.tsx), [`not-found.tsx`](../apps/web/src/app/not-found.tsx).

### Dashboard

Header actions: **Book Appointment**, **Reports & Analytics**, **Refresh Status**.

Four summary cards report:

- Today’s consultations
- Active Panchakarma
- Pharmacy dispensations
- Active staff session

Four tabs:

1. **Appointment Schedule** — today’s rows show time, patient, provider, type, status and actions; has an empty state.
2. **Panchakarma Therapy Suites** — suite/therapy operational panel. In the current page code the suite list is placeholder data.
3. **Pending Clinical Tasks** — task panel. Its task list is also placeholder data.
4. **System Health / API Auth** — API/auth diagnostic action with a visible success/error notification.

Appointment and summary data are fetched. Summary failure is converted to a null summary; appointment fetch failure is logged, while the API diagnostic gives a visible notification. Replicating behavior should preserve this distinction unless intentionally improved. Source: [`dashboard/page.tsx`](../apps/web/src/app/dashboard/page.tsx).

